window.products.push({"id":1132145,"name":"Welhome Preston Cotton Sateen Quilt Queen Set - 3 Piece | 1 Queen Quilt - 2 Pillow Shams | Designer Queen Bedspread | Winter Queen Size Bedding | Soft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wIF82kW-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY DESIGN in a range of neutral colors for easy coordination no matter the season or décor. Or select a pop of color for fashion fun. Features a stylish basket weave stitching detail that creates a smooth texture for an effortlessly chic yet minimal detail. Pair or gift with the August Comforter Set and 220TC Solid CVC Sheet Set by Welspun Basics to complete or compliment the look. Each sold separately. SLEEP WELL with a soft 100% cotton quilt. Like a calm oasis this quilt set features gorgeous stitching details that are then blended with smooth cotton sateen for a silky soft hand feel. You'll love your space and bed even more. A lightweight 200 thread-count is perfect for a comfortable layering warmth. Available in two sizes. Full/Queen Set Includes: 1 quilt (92in x 92in) and 2 standard shams (20in x 26in). King/Cal-King Set Includes: 1 quilt (108in x 92in) and 2 king shams (20in x 36in). MUST HAVE FEATURES for added comfort in your home. Whichever color you fancy it will add beauty with a touch of smooth cotton sateen fabric for a silk like softness and light lustrous sheen for an elevated look. Perfect as a stand-alone coverlet piece, guest quilt bedding set or any bedroom needing an extra thin layer. Easy to pair back or makeup with comforters, blankets, throws and decorative pillows. Great gift idea for housewarming gifts or college student dorm. Refresh your mattress today. QUALITY MATERIAL AND EASY CARE, machine washable, soft and breathable, lightweight cotton. Machine wash cold, delicate cycle with like colors. Use large capacity washer and dryer. Do not bleach, tumble dry low. Do not iron or dry clean. Styled with classic bound edges and mitered corners that deliver a polished tailored look. Pillow shams include center overlap closure to secure pillow fill. Both quilt and sham are filled with a lightweight 150 GSM, 100% Polyester for breathability and warmth. DESIGNED WITH CARE, Our product is Made in an Oeko-Tex Standard 100 Factory, an independent Certification system that ensures textiles meet high safety and environmental standards. Our products are also made using environmentally sustainable farming practices and water saving technologies. We care about the environment and guarantee our manufacturing is leading the way to a better tomorrow. Go ahead and feel good about making your house feel more like home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wIF82kW-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welhome","source_asin":"B09K7S194T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7S194T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7S194T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
