window.products.push({"id":1132585,"name":"Toilet Sword BETTER-THAN-A-PLUNGER Toilet Drain Snake Drain Clog Remover Bathroom Toilet Plunger w/ Holder Toilet Plunger Drain Opener Drain Snake Plu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RzaeSV2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Revolutionary: Ok, where do we begin on just how gross and disgusting toilet plungers are? None of them work very well. They have seams, joints, creases, made of material that collect feces, bacteria, used paper, and are impossible to clean. The Toilet Sword changes all of this! Innovative Design: Constructed of proprietary strong, solid material that will remain flexible enough to bend through the toilet trap-way and unclog your toilet, without splashing, displacing water, no mess, and extremely easy to clean with a simple wipe! With a built-in agitator shape on the tip of the sword to break up and poke through clogs. Non-marking and safe for all toilets. Flexible, Durable and Unbreakable Hygienic Problem Solver: Yes, the ancient plunger design is the most disgusting item in your home. Feces, dirty paper and bacteria stick to the inside and outside of rubber plungers, adhere to the handle and shaft, all the seams, nooks and crannies, creating a plunger that is a dripping, toxic mess that you’d rather throw away after use! The Toilet Sword is one piece, seamless, smooth, and amazingly easy to clean with a simple swipe with a disinfectant wipe Very User Friendly: The Toilet Sword is so much easier to use than a cumbersome, ill-fitting, feces splashing plunger. See videos! Simply rake the visible waste material away from the drain and insert the Toilet Sword into the toilet trap-way all the way until the handle is close to the rim. The toilet sword is long enough to insert past both curves in the drain, clearing the clog! Push and poke Toilet Sword firmly all the way in, it's flexible and will bend. Don't be afraid to push it all the way into the drain, it's flexible. What You Get: A Toilet Sword, a wall hook to hang it, and a five year warranty. Not all clogs can be solved by Toilet Swords and plungers. Some toilets drain slowly. Some drain lines have issues with slope, swales, sags and root infestation. In these cases a long toilet auger or the services of a plumber may be necessary. Clear Flushing!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RzaeSV2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEEGAN TOOLS","source_asin":"B09DYHMYTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYHMYTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYHMYTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
