window.products.push({"id":1132689,"name":"InterDesign Una Rectangular Trash Can with Handles, Waste Basket Garbage Can for Bathroom, Bedroom, Home Office, Dorm, College, 12-Inch, Light Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511YjhpZ6iL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The iDesign Una Trash Can is a modern and functional addition to your space. It features a sleek, streamlined design perfect for your kitchen, dorm, bedroom, bathroom, office, or anywhere else in your home. Integrated handles make it easy to move the garbage can from room to room or take out the trash. Made of durable plastic, this wastebasket is designed to last for years to come. It provides ample room for garbage or recycling. Measuring 12\" x 6.5\" x 10.8\", the Una Waste Can is slim and will fit perfectly wherever you need it. With iDesign by InterDesign, you can #LiveSimply every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511YjhpZ6iL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDesign","source_asin":"B01MYAATIX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MYAATIX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MYAATIX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1132690,"name":"BandTie Convenient Travel Office Ceramics Teacup Loose Leaf Tea Brewing System-Chinese Jingdezhen Blue and White Porcelain Tea Cup Infuser 4-Piece Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811V7NIGWvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT IS BLUE AND WHITE PORCELAIN Blue and white porcelain,also known as the white ground blue and white porcelain, often referred to as \"blue and white\". It is one of the mainstream of Chinese porcelain. “blue and white\"is to use natural materials in white mud painting decoration, then cover in a transparent glaze, and then the next firing on high temperature,1300 degrees Celsius high-temperature calcination,  make the pigment sufficient penetration in billet glaze, rendering the beautiful and luxuriant.  Then,it will appear blue color decorative pattern, which is deep and remote,bright and clean simple but elegant. BandTie 4-Piece personal teacup,1 set include a cup lid,a cup,a tea strainer and a saucer. This is a professional tea cup,Suitable for all kinds of black tea,green tea,flower tea and pu'er tea. ENJOY YOUR TEA ★ When you are meeting in the meeting room, you can make a cup of strong tea to take in. ★ When you are reading a book quietly in the study room, you can make a cup of green tea to take in. ★ When you appreciate the outside flowers in your house,you can make a cup of jasmine tea with this teacup...... HOW TO MAKE YOUR TEA WITH THIS TEACUP 1.Choose the tea you like to drink and the boiling water. 2.Put suitable amount of tea leaves into the filter and set in the tea body. 3.Pour boiling fresh water in.Normally speaking,we will not drink the tea for the first time make. We call the first time make is wash tea leaves.Someone may be wash twice or more. 4.Soak the tea leaves in the filter for a while(about 5-20 second). 5.Take out your tea strainer,you can put it on the saucer.It's very convenience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811V7NIGWvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BandTie","source_asin":"B01IPTR6Q8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IPTR6Q8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IPTR6Q8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
