window.products.push({"id":1132714,"name":"Libbey Vibe Mini Glass Jars with Lids, Set of 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91v8N6MHrQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your spices organized with this stylish set of 12 Vibe Mini Glass Jars from Libbey, which include matching airtight, BPA-free lids to help preserve flavor and keep your spices fresh. Featuring a distinctive sloped design that lends a modern air, the wide base also provides a good grip. They're great for showing off on your countertop, but they're also compact enough for spice racks, cupboards, and drawers. Your kitchen or pantry will look fresh and modern thanks to the decorative jar design, and presentable glass storage containers will always be right within reach. These durable, mini-sized glass jars are great for storing ground spices, herbs, and specialty salts. They're also perfect for gifting spice blends, storing craft materials like beads, and more. Each jar has a 4.5-ounce capacity and measures 2.75 inches tall and 2.625 inches round. Dishwasher safe for quick, easy cleanup. Made lead-free in the USA. Celebrate This with Glassware from Libbey If you’ve ever sipped from a glass, odds are you’ve already met Libbey. We rank as the top glassware manufacturer in the Americas and one of the largest tableware suppliers in the world. As the runaway leader, we are setting new standards for stability, strength, and growth opportunity. We believe every occasion — big and small — is an opportunity to celebrate life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91v8N6MHrQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Libbey","source_asin":"B00LMMGUOU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LMMGUOU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LMMGUOU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
