window.products.push({"id":1132738,"name":"ROMYtendency Shower Caddy Tote Bag - Toiletry Mesh Storage with Shower ball set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sg73YBl3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Multi shower caddy Package Included 1 mesh shower tote bag 1 shower sponge ( color will be selected randomly.) About Product Our shower tote has 6 outer compartments and a large compartment in the middle to easily store everything you need, including shampoo, conditioner, soap, comb, toothbrush, shaver, and Keep them tidy. Also It`s suitable for your outside activities because it is light and easy to carry around. beach, picnic, gym etc.. Dimensions: 9.8 x 8.6 x 4.7 inches. Structure: 6 outer pockets and 1 main large compartment. Unique design: It is a pretty tote bag with a pattern of birds, butterflies, and pink color harmony. The high-quality waterproof oxford with mesh shower tote bag does not collect water and dries quickly. It is machine washable, saving you time and effort. It is rugged and can be used for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sg73YBl3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROMYtendency","source_asin":"B087CKXBJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087CKXBJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087CKXBJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1132739,"name":"11 ounce Mug - Sunny Manatee Mugs - S White \"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AbHpFVavL._AC_.jpg","description":"11 ounce ceramic printed coffee mugs made-to-order. For art info or special request please message us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AbHpFVavL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coffee Mug","source_asin":"B01B6M4JXO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B6M4JXO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B6M4JXO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1132740,"name":"Ozeri The All-In-One Green Sauce Pan, 5 L (5.3 Quart)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7164F7NNgwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Utilizing a custom-formulated ceramic coating from Germany, the 5 L (5.3 Quart) All-In-One Green Earth Sauce Pan by Ozeri reigns with its ability to deliver non-stick perfection while remaining absolutely free of toxic substances such as APEO, GenX fluorinated chemicals, PFBS, PFOS, PFOA, and the lesser known NMP and NEP. According to the FDA, many of these chemicals constitute a worrisome class of nonstick compounds that have found their way into the food chain. Both EPA and FDA research on exposure to some of these compounds suggest associations with several kinds of cancers and health issues. Although the harmful PFOA and PFOS acids are being phased out of production, non-stick coatings today are often made with the aid of a new generation of fluoropolymers, known as GenX fluorinated chemicals and PFBS, which the EPA has more recently cited as suggestive of cancer and when consumed, may affect the kidneys, blood, immune system, liver and developing fetuses. Also of concern are APEO chemicals, which are restricted in Germany due to potential toxicity. By not using these ‘forever chemicals,’ the Green Earth Sauce Pan's German-made coating stands ahead of the curve, achieving the highest marks for food safety and environmental health. The Green Earth Sauce Pan’s coating is applied using a water-based technique that is also free of the lesser-known but potentially harmful chemicals NMP and NEP, sometimes found in traditional cookware. The Sauce Pan is far more durable and scratch-resistant than other non-stick surfaces, and always a breeze to clean. The Green Earth Sauce Pan is made of a heavy-gauge aluminum core that allows for quick and even cooking without hot spots. It boasts a magnetized bottom for use on induction stoves, a heat-resistant silicone-coated handle, a side helper handle, and a tempered glass lid with a steam release vent and heat-resistant knob. Coating made by Weilburger GmbH, Germany. Pan assembled in China..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7164F7NNgwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ozeri","source_asin":"B01AOOH0Y0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AOOH0Y0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AOOH0Y0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
