window.products.push({"id":1132825,"name":"Mind Reader BAMDISP-BRN Coffee Condiment and Accessories Caddy 9 Organizing Compartments, Bamboo Brown, One Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uJ2V3KpGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Straighten up your tabletop, counter, or makeup table with this multi-function bamboo organizer from Mind Reader Products.Eliminate clutter from your desktop with a convenient supply organizer from Mind Reader products. Constructed from natural, reliable bamboo, this convenient holder helps you sort and stash forks, knives, spoons, napkins, condiments, or even office essentials and makeup supplies. The multi-compartment design allows you to easily sort and locate whatever you need, precisely when you need it.A handy multi-section layout with open accessibility makes it a breeze for you to organize and store objects that can easily get mixed up or lost when just laying on your tabletop, countertop, or desk, so you can more conveniently keep track of them. Use this functional organizer for your utensils and condiments in the kitchen or at a coffee station, office supplies, school supplies, craft supplies and paintbrushes, or even to sort your makeup supplies and brushes. The natural bamboo finish makes a stylish addition to your home or office kitchen counter, breakroom, or makeup station, and resists moisture and mildew.As versatile as your priorities, this sturdy utensil organizer from Mind Reader Products puts organization at your fingertips.Dimensions: 12 L x 12 W x 5.5 HMaterials: Natural Bamboo\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uJ2V3KpGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mind Reader","source_asin":"B07VVRWRQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VVRWRQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VVRWRQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1132826,"name":"PORLAE Weighted Blanket (15 lbs - 48''x71'') | Cool Heavy Blanket for Hot & Cold Sleepers | Kids or Adult | 100% Cotton (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mAWcgRK0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"👍 Our weighted blanket is sold without DUVET COVER, please PURCHASE one separately. The DUVET is much easier to clean, and could help to extend the service life of your blanket. 👍 It's normal to feel heavy. Weighted blanket is more heavier than normal blanket and duvet. You may feel heavy at first, but the weight of blanket is helpful to relax your body and helps you to fall asleep faster. If you choose a fit size and weight base on your weight, usually after using it 7-10 days continuously, your body will adapt to this weight. 👍 A weighted blanket is usually smaller than your regular blanket of the same size, which could help to concentrate the weight on your body. 👍 The material of our weighted blanket is soft and breathable, which is suitable for all seasons. Hot sleepers may feel hot using this blanket during warm days due to its weight, so a fan or an AC. is recommended. 👍 The weighted blanket is machine-washable on a gentle setting, dry clean or hand-wash is better. NOTE: The minimum age for the use of a weighted blanket is 13 years old. Pregnant women, babys under 5 years old and people who can't move the heavy blanket themselves are prohibited to use.Weighted blankets should never be used to restrain a person or restrict their movement. Old people and people with less strength, it is recommended to buy lighter than the recommended weight. Weighted Blankets should never go past the shoulders, and should never cover the head. Do not allow pets to bite or scratch blankets. Do not allow sharp objects to pierce the blanket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mAWcgRK0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PORLAE","source_asin":"B07W54WZ72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W54WZ72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W54WZ72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
