window.products.push({"id":1132847,"name":"Parastone Venus of Willendorf Prehistoric Mother Goddess Statue Resin Aged Finish Detachable Metal Stand VEN01","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gaW6hWGFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The earliest surviving sculpture of a Prehistoric mother goddess is here reproduced for you!  Venus of Willendorf (24,000 - 22,000 BC) This figurine was found in the Austrian village of Willendorf in 1908 and dates back to the Paleolithic period of prehistoric times.. The voluptuous female figurine is cut from oolith (limestone), a type of stone which originally was not found in this area. \"Venus figurines\" is a collective term for prehistoric female figurines ever since the Marquis de Vibraye named a prehistoric nude female figurine a Venus Impudique (indecent Venus), which is a pun on the Roman Venus Pudica. The true meaning of the Venus figurines is unknown. It is likely that, in the hunter and collector society of those days, their corpulence stood for prosperity and fertility. The Venus of Willendorf bests all other Venus figurines in its corpulence. The female sexual characteristics are presented very explicitly and enlarged on the contrary to the face, arms and legs which, apparently, were less important. Even her faces was de-emphasized as it is covered with a hair pattern instead of her actual facial features.  Venus de Willendorf Statue is made from resin with a rust stone finish and black metal stand. Statue can be removed from metal stand and placed in your hand. Comes with a color description card in four languages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gaW6hWGFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parastone","source_asin":"B002E3GS0M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1132847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002E3GS0M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002E3GS0M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
